[{"title":"挽知临安府兼浙西制置使曾公 其一","author":"曾子良","text":"德祐思良弼，江西出大臣。\n报忠昭汉议，靖献有殷仁。\n皦日五朝老，清风百世人。\n几时归衮绣，秋草卧麒麟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77358,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽知临安府兼浙西制置使曾公 其三","author":"曾子良","text":"立海终风黑，洗光双日红。\n馀波溅渤澥，仙仗岌崆峒。\n宗庙神灵在，公师礼数崇。\n平生精履屐，尚觉小臣忠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77359,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽知临安府兼浙西制置使曾公 其四","author":"曾子良","text":"返輤荣归寝，帷堂哭设衣。\n神情如梦叶，沧海怅心违。\n百世功言立，千年城郭非。\n任安犹未死，哀泪不堪挥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77360,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽知临安府兼浙西制置使曾公 其二","author":"曾子良","text":"永绍传贤启，慈元拱女尧。\n鳌山犹赑屃，鹏海极扶摇。\n宫殿春旗晓，帘帷社饭朝。\n龙髯攀不及，鸾驭去何遥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77361,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题高远楼","author":"曾子良","text":"独行三十六峰头，飞过东华百尺楼。\n今日中原前日梦，天人极乐世人愁。\n后千载续后千载，外九州环外九州。\n此处名烦君著眼，区区复记又何求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77362,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题章明叔春雨庵","author":"曾子良","text":"春雨生草木，雨去作流水。\n流水不顾返，草木生未已。\n愿随流水去，一日行万里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77363,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头","author":"曾中思","text":"有客泛轻舸，迤逦到桐庐。\n山湾水曲，个中依约是仙区。\n试唤清江渔父，为问来今往古，兴废事如何。\n笑指寒烟里，此是子陵居。\n汉光武，兴皇运，握乾符。\n客星侵座，方见不与故人疏。\n自是先生高尚，无限经纶才略，飘泛寄江湖。\n凛凛亘千载，风月属樵渔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77364,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入紫石硖","author":"曾丰","text":"一棹从来十五年，眼中髣髴旧山川。\n砚材犹伏岩深处，已吐鹅溪素上烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77365,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月六日送巩帅邮亭上","author":"曾丰","text":"有时夜燕归乘月，未始晨兴出戴星。\n半载初逢迎送事，五更已至短长亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77366,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上广东运副马少卿寿十口号 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"魁星又转作文星，玉笋班分博士清。\n鼓舞辟雍群弟子，依归绛帐老先生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77367,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上广东运副马少卿寿十口号 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"寿星瑞世现光明，俄转桐江作客星。\n千载严陵后身出，风标气概两亭亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77368,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上广东运副马少卿寿十口号 其九","author":"曾丰","text":"平星转作上台星，独运璇玑握玉衡。\n蹀躞稳行黄道阔，荧煌长伴紫微明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77369,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上广东运副马少卿寿十口号 其五","author":"曾丰","text":"郎星又转作侯星，上据中阶下列城。\n时号嘉兴为辅郡，出分重寄护行京。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77370,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上广东运副马少卿寿十口号 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"客星又转作魁星，蚤应文科策汉庭。\n紫气初来朝北极，长鹍一奋刷南溟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77371,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上广东运副马少卿寿十口号 其八","author":"曾丰","text":"枢星转作内平星，内得其平外亦平。\n贯索已沉牢口退，又随钱谷向南明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77372,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上广东运副马少卿寿十口号 其七","author":"曾丰","text":"使星转作副枢星，天柱天阶两手擎。\n阉倖斜晖欲相射，回躔退舍养吾明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77373,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上广东运副马少卿寿十口号 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"文星又转作郎星，晓握兰香上玉清。\n屹立太微东北角，是非时与上台争。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77374,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上广东运副马少卿寿十口号 其十","author":"曾丰","text":"台星久出照寰瀛，懒入端门傍御屏。\n上扣北辰乞闲散，南归长作老人星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77375,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲访约斋未果两绝句下逮 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"倦游长闭读书斋，重与人交省往来。\n陡觉心中生羽翼，祇缘句里挟风雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77376,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"久欲访约斋未果两绝句下逮 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"京师谁可与论文，好事纷纷访子云。\n犹恨闻名未相见，见时当更过于闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77377,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义宁产莼菜中秋大熟副以六绝送杨伯子 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"秋行春令气犹凝，柳曳寒丝软蘸冰。\n又似瑶池乐棚下，鬼工遗落水晶藤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77378,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义宁产莼菜中秋大熟副以六绝送杨伯子 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"赍芝自可侑仙斟，忌把鲜肥俗味侵。\n羹莼鲙鳞清浊混，季鹰犹未是知音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77379,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义宁产莼菜中秋大熟副以六绝送杨伯子 其五","author":"曾丰","text":"仙苗风味淡为宗，能诱长安客欲东。\n浪说栈羊馀隽永，施于高士了无功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77380,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义宁产莼菜中秋大熟副以六绝送杨伯子 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"垂垂水线白封青，一箸能生两眼明。\n分野自为牛女地，何如堕落玉绳精。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77381,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义宁产莼菜中秋大熟副以六绝送杨伯子 其六","author":"曾丰","text":"蟹肥鲈腯未多誇，橘绿橙黄正自嘉。\n左手把莼右持酒，何当共醉木犀花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77382,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义宁产莼菜中秋大熟副以六绝送杨伯子 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"吴人缕玉作常烹，南粤相逢眼却生。\n张翰思归食忘味，鉴湖震泽见于羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77383,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乡友严上舍过我妙山逆旅中示二绝句随继韵谢 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"相逢初不出相期，笑见熙间喜见眉。\n总是庐陵老禅客，未询其价已先知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77384,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乡友严上舍过我妙山逆旅中示二绝句随继韵谢 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"诗交便是可忘年，要结江西一段缘。\n先觉恐犹资后觉，觉机无后亦无先。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77385,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山谷诗集有题净因寺壁二绝句未知寺在何处甲子秋余游富阳妙山之净因寺用次山谷韵书以遗寺僧如智 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"迂路游山信爱山，偷闲疑未是真闲。\n烟霞谢事其容傲，猿鹤知机也意阑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77386,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山谷诗集有题净因寺壁二绝句未知寺在何处甲子秋余游富阳妙山之净因寺用次山谷韵书以遗寺僧如智 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"三向稚松争短长，西偏老竹绝炎凉。\n千寻以上有秋色，万亩之间无夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77387,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中都之嘉会门陈亦颜为堂曰城南书院取韩文公符读书意也 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"客来草草治杯盘，道与家人勿惮烦。\n但要陶泓毛颖在，未为无以遗儿孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77388,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中都之嘉会门陈亦颜为堂曰城南书院取韩文公符读书意也 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"姓名不欲乐人闻，籍甚公卿举似君。\n李白犹将奴力士，薛宣岂敢吏朱云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77389,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中都之嘉会门陈亦颜为堂曰城南书院取韩文公符读书意也 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"宁开白眼视公卿，不要公卿眼借青。\n争利争名醒处看，读诗读礼醉时听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77390,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中都之嘉会门陈亦颜为堂曰城南书院取韩文公符读书意也 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"买宅犹难况买邻，一区判与九衢亲。\n那知万壑千岩性，不受高车驷马尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77391,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中都寄广东提干彭元忠 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"十期九度自参差，彼此无词可遂非。\n投老江西沙石畔，鸥盟不请更相违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77392,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中都寄广东提干彭元忠 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"同年同郡更同官，无适非同况岁寒。\n最是西湖好同赏，却相先后到长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77393,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中都寄广东提干彭元忠 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"君到韶如杜到夔，新功不比旧炉锤。\n磨砻诗律如韶律，未必知音有仲尼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77394,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中都寄广东提干彭元忠 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"舜峰虫鸟乱号鸣，犹是箫韶节奏馀。\n入耳虽归哦咏里，收心更听寂寥初。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77395,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬戌二月十九日都巡李叔永躬按酒课于会田市二十八日闻余且至还家若相避然赋三绝 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"主人未叱曲车回，客子涎流口欲开。\n阮籍已收青眼去，陶潜休望白衣来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77396,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬戌二月十九日都巡李叔永躬按酒课于会田市二十八日闻余且至还家若相避然赋三绝 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"宜城桑落有堪沽，三百青铜岂是无。\n不饮桃花不相笑，桃花知道欠当垆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77397,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬戌二月十九日都巡李叔永躬按酒课于会田市二十八日闻余且至还家若相避然赋三绝 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"临邛界里杏花村，戏著家人犊鼻裈。\n试问长卿躬涤器，何如作赋献金门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77398,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太平老豁庵","author":"曾丰","text":"父母胞胎未结前，赵州识后笑南泉。\n豁然道与虚空似，不道虚空似豁然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77399,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方稚川恕斋五绝 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"此道固非浅，圣门两三人。\n佳名长在眼，无实勿为宾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77400,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邓节仲卒而未葬其孤与祖以其情诉赋绝句授之为持以呈其亲旧间","author":"曾丰","text":"为亲未葬走人门，首有涪翁诗案存。\n试为君家一拈出，麦舟故事几人援。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77401,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代董华卿以葺庐无力告于亲旧间 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"辟谷无方强忍贫，今难于忍以情陈。\n不反君眼青为白，可使吾庐故作新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77402,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代董华卿以葺庐无力告于亲旧间 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"败屋犹馀茅不多，其如凌雨震风何。\n破谁一部悭贪相，还我数间安乐窝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77403,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代墨客卿自赋赠安城彭云翼 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"同为时用楮先生，万事须臾点化成。\n寄语先生幸相避，不须黑白太分明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77404,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代墨客卿自赋赠安城彭云翼 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"决策初如媚灶然，触机融理悟吹烟。\n从教时尚白之白，与道俱云玄又玄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77405,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出东城门见牧牛","author":"曾丰","text":"出逢春客放牛天，浩叹微官久自缠。\n回首未能收白牯，归家犹可养乌犍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77406,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戊申除夕送岁","author":"曾丰","text":"四十馀番送岁回，百年身世半摧颓。\n更将四十馀番送，岁定相辞不复来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77407,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春","author":"曾丰","text":"羯鼓催春春尚回，况公夜拥软红灰。\n五更温厚东南气，煦煦妓围深处来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77408,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伏波庙","author":"曾丰","text":"古庙秋深栗叶红，绿沉金锁尚英风。\n鹄书示子今来少，谁似当年矍铄翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77409,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再游南华有祖师衣钵 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"西方达磨问归程，衣钵都留作么生。\n正道眼空嫌长物，如何更带履同行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77410,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再游南华有祖师衣钵 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"达磨将身带履归，殷勤分付钵和衣。\n更和衣钵将归去，免与中原讲是非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77411,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再游南华有祖师衣钵 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"佛自无言人自讹，但留衣钵说能多。\n假令和履多留下，谁奈沙门颊舌何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77412,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回雁峰 其四","author":"曾丰","text":"雁入穷南失意多，以峰为记誓毋过。\n宁无忘记蹉过去，彼自轻生独奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77413,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回雁峰 其五","author":"曾丰","text":"此峰与雁作标题，记不分明有忘时。\n雁自会书真草字，标题安用此峰为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77414,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回雁峰 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"宾鸿初忌瘴边岚，止到峰前不更南。\n近日鸿多更南去，峰名几似晋清谈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77415,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回雁峰 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"扬雄非有动人姿，盖代清名天下知。\n回雁名今与雄等，岂忘外陋慕中奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77416,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回雁峰 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"每向画图诗集看，祝融如孔雁如颜。\n雁峰今幸一相识，实校于名大似悭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77417,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有售画于余令作杨柳黄鹂池塘萱草既成可观用随其题赋二绝句 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"寻常鹂在柳间鸣，娇色娇声两尽情。\n兹妞尔娇明弄色，御沟何恨笑吞声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77418,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有售画于余令作杨柳黄鹂池塘萱草既成可观用随其题赋二绝句 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"一段池塘萱草奇，其形便画理便诗。\n到离形处画之妙，诗妙更无形可离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77419,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨诚斋雪中 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"雪儿初是玉仙妃，谪堕人间尚缟衣。\n扑地狂风相衮起，疑乘白鹤刺天飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77420,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨诚斋雪中 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"夜闭袁门晏未开，开门满目是琼瑰。\n木绵著地还飞起，杨絮沾人倒扑回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77421,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵酬姜邦杰雪中见寄","author":"曾丰","text":"十人赋分九穷寒，古说天悭今不悭。\n一夜尽开多宝藏，施银为地玉为山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77422,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老范善画牛有学为八牛图者一犊在前又置一童持竿牧其后 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"谁谓群牛戏写真，犊前牝后更精神。\n不知老牯心枯淡，岂有将身作化身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77423,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老范善画牛有学为八牛图者一犊在前又置一童持竿牧其后 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"熟事沩山白水牛，晓那须放夜那收。\n牧童已作冗员看，况复持竿在后头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77424,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西蜀泉上人久留中都 其三","author":"曾丰","text":"特地东游访祖师，东人占了钵和衣。\n幸馀只履为心印，犹在西方可急归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77425,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西蜀泉上人久留中都 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"担水人家旦过寮，骑牛来看浙江潮。\n相逢便说三生话，不管人言舌太饶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77426,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西蜀泉上人久留中都 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"佛出西方打底州，西人何用更东游。\n骑驴莫说寻驴事，办取工夫一转头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77427,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观故中书舍人张公所书时氏家系","author":"曾丰","text":"百年中表朱陈宅，十世婚姻嫁娶图。\n词翰所形高谊激，子孙其忍旧盟渝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77428,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观除目 其二","author":"曾丰","text":"四正宫中坐五穷，若于群在不吾攻。\n畏途过后犹寒胆，除目陈前不热中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77429,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观除目 其一","author":"曾丰","text":"某曾同宦某同年，鹏翼摩云背负天。\n已觉卑飞难得路，未容高蹈重归田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77430,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]